OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunday will start rather cloudy
OL,6,Fwith patchy rain. An isolated shower
OL,7,Fis possible during the remainder of
OL,8,Fthe day, though most areas will become
OL,9,Fdry with skies brightening at times in
OL,10,Fthe afternoon. Very warm in the
OL,11,Fsunshine, though breezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAn isolated light shower is
OL,14,Fstill possible during the evening, but
OL,15,Fmost areas will be dry and clear
OL,16,Fspells will develop at times,
OL,17,Fespecially overnight. A mild, though
OL,18,Fbreezy night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
