OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FMonday will be a generally dry
OL,6,Fday across the region with bright or
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Some more prolonged
OL,8,Fsunshine is possible later. Becoming
OL,9,Fvery warm in lighter winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FThe
OL,12,Fweather looks dry and settled through
OL,13,Fthe period. There will be plenty of
OL,14,Fsunshine, and temperatures will creep
OL,15,Fback up, so feeling hot again, with
OL,16,Fwinds remaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
